  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ non-Tuners

    Gains ATK equal to the total original
    ATK of all other Synchro Monsters you control. You can only use each of the following
    effects of "Crimson Dragon Quetzalcoatl" once per turn. If this card is Synchro
    Summoned: You can Special Summon as many Dragon Synchro Monsters from your GY
    as possible, also you cannot Special Summon for the rest of this turn. When your
    opponent activates a monster effect (Quick Effect): You can return 1 other Dragon
    Synchro Monster you control to the Extra Deck, and if you do, negate that activation.'
